WEBVTT

00:08:59.014 --> 00:09:02.582
so full of unknown we think it's empty.

00:09:02.582 --> 00:09:08.797
At my feet, the path to the north tower -- 60 yards of wire rope.

00:09:08.797 --> 00:09:12.178
It's a straight line, which sags,

00:09:12.178 --> 00:09:15.699
which sways, which vibrates,

00:09:15.699 --> 00:09:17.263
which rolls on itself,

00:09:17.263 --> 00:09:18.998
which is ice,

00:09:18.998 --> 00:09:23.367
which is three tons tight, ready to explode,

00:09:23.367 --> 00:09:25.981
ready to swallow me.

00:09:25.981 --> 00:09:28.947
An inner howl assails me,

00:09:28.947 --> 00:09:31.964
the wild longing to flee.